elephant and giraffe they all abound the area around elsa's rock is now a game reserve and all these creatures are protected it's george's job to ensure their safety but it's not an easy one for although hunting is illegal there are always plenty who will break the law for financial gain a gang of poachers had set this trap hoping to catch a rhino whose horn they could sell at an

